    white-space: pre;
    font: normal 14px monospace;
}
&lt;/style&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This program calculates your &lt;a href="http://www.wheresgeorge.com/"&gt;Where&amp;#39;s George&lt;/a&gt; score, given the number of bills entered and hits received. It also calculates how many bills or hits you need to increase your George Score by 1.&lt;/p&gt;

